  "chapter": 761,
  "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
  "text": " \n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 122 Chapter 761\n \n        MEMORANDUM filed with Senate Bill Number 653-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN ACT to amend the insurance law, in relation to electronic deliv-\n        ery of property/casualty insurance notices\"\n \n    APPROVED\n \n  This  bill  would  permit insurers to deliver notices and documents to\npolicyholiders with their consent.\n \n  I agree with the intent of the bill. I have reached agreement with the\nLegislature on a  modification  that  ensures  that  policyholders  must\nconsent  to  the  particular  type of notice that will be sent electron-\nically by an insurer.\n \n  Based on this agreement, I am pleased to sign this bill.\n \n  This bill is approved.                         (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                                ______\n",
  "year": 2021
 },
